      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "A family converts inaccessible pointwise cancellation into collective structure, while positivity converts collective control back into a pointwise conclusion. The diagonal is the easy coarse contribution; off-diagonal correlation records the information lost when one treats family members as independent.",
